    .label = Delete from reMarkable when removed from sync

pref-formats-title = Formats
pref-formats-convert-docx =
    .label = Auto-convert .docx to EPUB for sync
pref-formats-convert-docx-help = reMarkable has no native Word support. When on, tagged .docx attachments get a generated read-only EPUB companion that is kept in sync instead — the original .docx is never modified.
pref-formats-sync-notes =
    .label = Sync tagged notes as documents
pref-formats-sync-notes-help = Push tagged standalone or child notes to reMarkable as their own EPUB document. One-way (Zotero → device) — notes have no annotation layer to pull back into.

